{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>清水灣今日（25日）發生嚴重車禍。傍晚6時31分，警方接報指，清水灣道與大坳門路交界，近清水灣花園對開，有一名年約60歲男途人被小巴撞倒後，復捲入車底。男事主頭部受傷昏迷。</p><p>消防及救護員到場，救出被困男子，隨即將他送往將軍澳醫院搶救。警方正調查事故原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"傷者被困車底，獲救後送往將軍澳醫院治理。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193935477690863616076432.jpeg/7rfuYr4vehJm-StpGgHAtKZ2ZgtTZ_tbi0Ghh4tBoYc\"/><figcaption>傷者被困車底，獲救後送往將軍澳醫院治理。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T11:54:48.001043+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T11:26:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T12:05:25.444874+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T11:48:13.511485+00:00","content_hash":"abf83f1582163026c7c0c264a290474b758f664d340401e67987cc4c134f31c6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}